meta {
  name: 21-List the reviews I've received
  type: http
  seq: 21
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/users/{{emeka_user_id}}/reviews?page=0&size=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{emeka_jwt}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  My reviews — the ones owners and applicants will scroll. Solo run
  this is empty (no closed deals yet) but the endpoint exists and
  paginates, which is the right shape.

  GAP: no way for me to RESPOND to a review (e.g., "thanks Temi —
  it was a pleasure"). Every other agent platform supports that.
  Right now my reputation is one-way.
}
